# 🚀 Spec-Kit Final - Automated Implementation

**Version:** V6 MVP (Sequential Execution)
**Purpose:** Automate F4 delegation by reading ORCHESTRATION.md and launching agents sequentially with checkpoints.

**Context Argument:** $ARGUMENTS (expected: project path, e.g., "test-v6-mvp/")

**Before (V5.2.1):**
```bash
/speckit.agents → ORCHESTRATION.md + implementation-prompt.md
# User copies implementation-prompt.md manually (5-10 min)
/implement [paste prompt]
```

**After (V6 MVP):**
```bash
/speckit.agents → ORCHESTRATION.md + observability-pulse.jsonl
/speckit.final  → Reads ORCHESTRATION.md, launches agents automatically
```

**Time Saved:** -5 to -10 minutes + 0 copy-paste errors

